# Project hooks

This directory documents the project-specific hooks of the SDD harness for {{HARNESS_NAME}}.

Hooks are enabled from the harness's wiring file ({{HOOK_WIRING_FILE}}), not by placing scripts here automatically. The scripts are harness-neutral (see the adapter block at the top of each one); only the wiring is harness-specific.

